=== R4: the void predicate under a non-UTC session TimeZone ===
A charge whose period starts on the boundary day, with the boundary late in the UTC day:
SET
    session_tz    | old_session_tz_form | new_utc_form 
------------------+---------------------+--------------
 Pacific/Auckland | f                   | t
(1 row)

The old form drops the charge from the void set purely because of the session
timezone; the UTC-anchored form is stable. Same query under TimeZone='UTC':
SET
 old_session_tz_form | new_utc_form 
---------------------+--------------
 t                   | t
(1 row)


